        <h1 class="heading-1 mb-6">Grok AI Under Global Regulatory Scrutiny: EU, UK, and International Investigations</h1>

        <p class="text-xl text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
          xAI's <strong>Grok AI</strong> faces unprecedented regulatory pressure in January 2026, with formal investigations launched by the European Commission under the DSA, the UK's Ofcom, and warnings from multiple countries regarding image generation concerns.
        </p>

        <!-- Breaking News Box -->
